# fxc writes one header per shader stage here as part of building Outpost.exe
# (see Outpost.vcxproj). They are build output: the source is the .hlsl files in
# Outpost/Shaders, and a checked-in copy would be a second answer to what the
# shaders compile to, free to disagree with the first.
#
# This file is here so a fresh clone has the directory. The project also creates
# it (EnsureCompiledShaderDirectory), because a clone is not the only way the
# build starts.
*.h
*.cso
